            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Here is a small, typed debounce:\n\n```ts\nfunction debounce<Args extends unknown[]>(fn: (...args: Args) => void, waitMs: number) {\n    let timer: ReturnType<typeof setTimeout> | undefined;\n    return (...args: Args) => {\n        clearTimeout(timer);\n        timer = setTimeout(() => fn(...args), waitMs);\n    };\n}\n```\n\nEach call cancels the pending one and starts a new timer, so `fn` only runs after calls have stopped for `waitMs`. Use it as `const onType = debounce(search, 250)`."
              }
            ]
          }
        }
